{"ghsa_id":"GHSA-vfmq-68hx-4jfw","cve_id":"CVE-2026-41066","url":"https://api.github.com/advisories/GHSA-vfmq-68hx-4jfw","html_url":"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-vfmq-68hx-4jfw","summary":"lxml: Default configuration of iterparse() and ETCompatXMLParser() allows XXE to local files","description":"### Impact\nUsing either of the two parsers in the default configuration (with `resolve_entities=True`) allows untrusted XML input to read local files.\n\n### Patches\nlxml 6.1.0 changes the default to `resolve_entities='internal'`, thus disallowing local file access by default.\n\n### Workarounds\nSetting the `resolve_entities` option explicitly to `resolve_entities='internal'` or `resolve_entities=False` disables the local file access.\n\n### Resources\nOriginal report: https://bugs.launchpad.net/lxml/+bug/2146291\n\nThe default option was changed to `resolve_entities='internal'` for the normal XML and HTML parsers in lxml 5.0. The default was not changed for `iterparse()` and `ETCompatXMLParser()` at the time. lxml 6.1 makes the safe option the default for all parsers.","type":"reviewed","severity":"high","repository_advisory_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lxml/lxml/security-advisories/GHSA-vfmq-68hx-4jfw","source_code_location":"https://github.com/lxml/lxml","identifiers":[{"value":"GHSA-vfmq-68hx-4jfw","type":"GHSA"},{"value":"CVE-2026-41066","type":"CVE"}],"references":["https://github.com/lxml/lxml/security/advisories/GHSA-vfmq-68hx-4jfw","https://bugs.launchpad.net/lxml/+bug/2146291","https://github.com/lxml/lxml/releases/tag/lxml-6.1.0","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-41066","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/tree/main/vulns/lxml/PYSEC-2026-87.yaml","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-vfmq-68hx-4jfw"],"published_at":"2026-04-21T20:38:44Z","updated_at":"2026-06-06T00:59:17Z","github_reviewed_at":"2026-04-21T20:38:44Z","nvd_published_at":"2026-04-24T17:16:20Z","withdrawn_at":null,"vulnerabilities":[{"package":{"ecosystem":"pip","name":"lxml"},"vulnerable_version_range":"< 6.1.0","first_patched_version":"6.1.0","vulnerable_functions":[]}],"cvss_severities":{"cvss_v3":{"vector_string":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:N/A:N","score":7.5},"cvss_v4":{"vector_string":null,"score":0.0}},"cwes":[{"cwe_id":"CWE-611","name":"Improper Restriction of XML External Entity Reference"}],"credits":[{"user":{"login":"Brubbish","id":29673689,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NjczNjg5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29673689?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brubbish","html_url":"https://github.com/Brubbish","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brubbish/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brubbish/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brubbish/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brubbish/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brubbish/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brubbish/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brubbish/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brubbish/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brubbish/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"type":"reporter"}],"comments":1,"epss":{"percentage":0.00324,"percentile":0.23519}}